WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:05.200
So we're here today looking at the new bridge&nbsp;
which is going in at Dawlish which will enable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.440
the building of more homes on this site. This&nbsp;
has been achieved through Devon County Council&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:15.600
and Teignbridge working together, with financial&nbsp;
support from the housing infrastructure fund,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.240
to actually deliver roads, before&nbsp;
houses, to save a huge amount of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:26.030
construction traffic going through Dawlish&nbsp;
and to enable another 800 homes to be built.

